       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is well above the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** The maximum is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision, and 2,400 mg/day is the usual practical ceiling. Higher doses add GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular risk without more benefit.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 600 mg PO four times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the absolute maximum)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I'd still advise against it."
      }
